        "original_id": "afe422ed-377b-51ad-a0c3-307328d82a2a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Orton, Bernard-Marie Koltès\n- Roles: Playwrights, authors, theatre directors\n- Works: La Nuit juste avant les Forêts, Sallinger, Dans la Solitude des Champs de Coton\n- Topics: English literature, French theatre\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Orton was born on 1 January 1933 and was an English playwright and author.\n- Bernard-Marie Koltès was born on 9 April 1948 and was a French playwright and theatre director.\n- Bernard-Marie Koltès wrote the play La Nuit juste avant les Forêts in 1976.\n- Bernard-Marie Koltès wrote the play Sallinger in 1977.\n- Bernard-Marie Koltès wrote the play Dans la Solitude des Champs de Coton in 1986.\n- Joe Orton died on 9 August 1967.\n- Bernard-Marie Koltès died on 15 April 1989.",
